{"t": 1795080592.981009, "tool": "analyze", "code": "def nmse(p): return np.mean((dA_dt-p)**2)/np.var(dA_dt)\nfor K in [4,6,8]:\n  for M in [1,2,3]:\n    cols=[];names=[]\n    for k in range(K+1):\n        for m in range(M+1):\n            cols.append(t**k*A**m); names.append((k,m))\n    X=np.column_stack(cols)\n    c=np.linalg.lstsq(X,dA_dt,rcond=None)[0]\n    print(K,M,nmse(X@c))\n# with 1/t and exp\ncols=[];\nfor k in range(-2,6):\n    for m in range(0,4):\n        cols.append(t**k*A**m)\nX=np.column_stack(cols); c=np.linalg.lstsq(X,dA_dt,rcond=None)[0]; print('neg',nmse(X@c))", "out": "4 1 0.009447379268875086\n4 2 0.006159511908679823\n4 3 0.006049464084244137\n6 1 0.004592299140745411\n6 2 0.0010275415282287855\n6 3 0.0009831109362305663\n8 1 0.0035242099410029335\n8 2 0.00013732481372455188\n8 3 0.00013342078130068732\nneg 2.9504483140022073e-08\n"}
