{"t": 1795080602.7577076, "tool": "analyze", "code": "def fit(cols,names):\n    X=np.column_stack(cols); c=np.linalg.lstsq(X,dA_dt,rcond=None)[0]\n    r=dA_dt-X@c\n    return np.mean(r**2)/np.var(dA_dt), dict(zip(names,c.round(4)))\nbase_t={'1/t':1/t,'1':t**0,'t':t,'t2':t**2,'1/t2':t**-2}\nA2=A**2\ncols=[];names=[]\nfor k,v in base_t.items(): cols.append(v); names.append(k)\nfor k,v in base_t.items(): cols.append(v*A2); names.append(k+'*A2')\nprint(fit(cols,names))\ncols2=cols+[A*t**0, A*t, A*(1/t)]; names2=names+['A','At','A/t']\nprint(fit(cols2,names2))\ncols3=cols+[t**-3, t**3, t**-1*A2*0+A2*t**3]; names3=names+['1/t3','t3','t3A2']\nprint(fit(cols3,names3))", "out": "(np.float64(1.160082844216075e-05), {'1/t': np.float64(2.8543), '1': np.float64(7.6249), 't': np.float64(-1.8878), 't2': np.float64(0.0912), '1/t2': np.float64(1.1911), '1/t*A2': np.float64(0.0903), '1*A2': np.float64(-0.1112), 't*A2': np.float64(-0.0386), 't2*A2': np.float64(0.0012), '1/t2*A2': np.float64(-0.0277)})\n(np.float64(1.1329042217221587e-05), {'1/t': np.float64(2.861), '1': np.float64(7.6328), 't': np.float64(-1.8891), 't2': np.float64(0.0913), '1/t2': np.float64(1.1926), '1/t*A2': np.float64(0.0946), '1*A2': np.float64(-0.1108), 't*A2': np.float64(-0.0385), 't2*A2': np.float64(0.0012), '1/t2*A2': np.float64(-0.0283), 'A': np.float64(-0.0059), 'At': np.float64(0.0005), 'A/t': np.float64(-0.0127)})\n(np.float64(1.3374955190612782e-06), {'1/t': np.float64(-0.1035), '1': np.float64(8.8938), 't': np.float64(-2.1136), 't2': np.float64(0.1071), '1/t2': np.float64(3.9298), '1/t*A2': np.float64(0.0413), '1*A2': np.float64(-0.0658), 't*A2': np.float64(-0.0552), 't2*A2': np.float64(0.0037), '1/t2*A2': np.float64(-0.0086), '1/t3': np.float64(-0.8338), 't3': np.float64(-0.0003), 't3A2': np.float64(-0.0001)})\n"}
